OL,3,ARow over Reform's mega donations has
OL,4,Amileage in it yet
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe #72m heading towards Reform UK's
OL,7,Fcoffers from two British billionaires
OL,8,Fis transforming the debate at
OL,9,FWestminster about politics and money.
OL,11,FIn short, how should political parties
OL,12,Fbe paid for, and by who?
OL,14,FAnd, what is a legitimate donation and
OL,15,Fwhat isn't?
OL,17,FThe government is planning to tighten
OL,18,Fresidency rules for people giving money
OL,19,Fto political parties, to ensure that
OL,20,Fthose making significant donations live
OL,21,Fin the UK.
